 "dialogue": [
  {
   "speaker": "Nigel",
   "en": "Good afternoon.",
   "zh": "下午好。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L089.mp4",
    "start": 7,
    "end": 8.5
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Nigel",
   "en": "I believe that this house is for sale.",
   "zh": "我想这房子是要出售的吧！",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L089.mp4",
    "start": 8.5,
    "end": 12.3
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Ian",
   "en": "That's right.",
   "zh": "是的。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L089.mp4",
    "start": 12.3,
    "end": 14.7
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Nigel",
   "en": "May I have a look at it, please?",
   "zh": "我可以看一看吗？",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L089.mp4",
    "start": 14.7,
    "end": 18.6
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Ian",
   "en": "Yes, of course.",
   "zh": "可以，当然可以。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L089.mp4",
    "start": 18.6,
    "end": 20.7
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Ian",
   "en": "Come in.",
   "zh": "请进。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L089.mp4",
    "start": 20.7,
    "end": 22.6
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Nigel",
   "en": "How long have you lived here?",
   "zh": "您在这里住了多长时间？",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L089.mp4",
    "start": 22.6,
    "end": 26
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Ian",
   "en": "I've lived here for twenty years.",
   "zh": "我在这里已经住了 20 年了。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L089.mp4",
    "start": 26,
    "end": 30.2
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Nigel",
   "en": "Twenty years!",
   "zh": "20 年！",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L089.mp4",
    "start": 30.2,
    "end": 32.1
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Nigel",
   "en": "That's a long time.",
   "zh": "这个时间可不短。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L089.mp4",
    "start": 32.1,
    "end": 34.7
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Ian",
   "en": "Yes, I've been here since 1976.",
   "zh": "是啊，从 1976 年起我就住在这里。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L089.mp4",
    "start": 34.7,
    "end": 41
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Nigel",
   "en": "Then why do you want to sell it?",
   "zh": "那么，您为什么要卖掉它呢？",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L089.mp4",
    "start": 41,
    "end": 44.5
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Ian",
   "en": "Because I've just retired.",
   "zh": "因为我刚退休。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L089.mp4",
    "start": 44.5,
    "end": 47.8
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Ian",
   "en": "I want to buy a small house in the country.",
   "zh": "我想在乡下买幢小房子。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L089.mp4",
    "start": 47.8,
    "end": 53.2
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Nigel",
   "en": "How much does this house cost?",
   "zh": "这座房子卖多少钱？",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L089.mp4",
    "start": 53.2,
    "end": 56.8
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Ian",
   "en": "£68,500.",
   "zh": "68,500 英镑。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L089.mp4",
    "start": 56.8,
    "end": 61.8
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Nigel",
   "en": "That's a lot of money!",
   "zh": "那可真是一大笔钱呢！",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L089.mp4",
    "start": 61.8,
    "end": 64.7
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Ian",
   "en": "It's worth every penny of it.",
   "zh": "它确确实实值这么多钱。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L089.mp4",
    "start": 64.7,
    "end": 68.2
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Nigel",
   "en": "Well, I like the house, but I can't decide yet.",
   "zh": "啊，我喜欢这房子，但我还不能决定。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L089.mp4",
    "start": 68.2,
    "end": 73.5
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Nigel",
   "en": "My wife must see it first.",
   "zh": "我妻子必须先来看一看。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L089.mp4",
    "start": 73.5,
    "end": 77.2
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Ian",
   "en": "Women always have the last word.",
   "zh": "女人总是最后说了算的。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L089.mp4",
    "start": 77.2,
    "end": 81.9
   }
  }
 ],
